---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Gosub - Brutal Independence</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Syne:wght@600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style lang="scss">
      :root {
        --bg: #ececec;
        --fg: #111111;
        --accent: #ff3300;
        --accent2: #0000ff;
        --font-display: 'Syne', sans-serif;
        --font-body: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      
      body {
        background-color: var(--bg);
        color: var(--fg);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        line-height: 1.5;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        border: 12px solid var(--fg);
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      .noise {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
        pointer-events: none; z-index: 50;
        opacity: 0.05;
        background: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"%3E%3Cfilter id="noiseFilter"%3E%3CfeTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.65" numOctaves="3" stitchTiles="stitch"/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width="100%25" height="100%25" filter="url(%23noiseFilter)"/%3E%3C/svg%3E');
      }

      header {
        border-bottom: 6px solid var(--fg);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        background: var(--bg);
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        
        .logo {
          font-family: var(--font-display);
          font-size: 2.5rem;
          font-weight: 800;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        nav a {
          font-family: var(--font-body);
          font-weight: 700;
          color: var(--fg);
          text-decoration: none;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          border: 2px solid var(--fg);
          padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
          margin-left: 1rem;
          transition: all 0.2s;
          box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--accent);

          &:hover {
            background: var(--fg);
            color: var(--bg);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--accent);
            transform: translate(4px, 4px);
          }
        }
      }

      main {
        padding: 4rem 2rem;
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 4rem;
        margin-bottom: 6rem;
        align-items: center;

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        h1 {
          font-family: var(--font-display);
          font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 10rem);
          font-weight: 800;
          line-height: 0.85;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
          
          span {
            display: block;
            color: var(--accent);
            text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--fg);
          }
        }

        p {
          font-size: 1.25rem;
          max-width: 600px;
          border-left: 6px solid var(--accent2);
          padding-left: 1.5rem;
          font-weight: 700;
        }
      }

      .marquee {
        width: 100vw;
        margin-left: -2rem;
        background: var(--fg);
        color: var(--bg);
        padding: 1rem 0;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 3rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
        transform: rotate(-2deg) scale(1.05);
        border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);
        border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent);
        z-index: 5;

        .marquee-inner {
          display: inline-block;
          animation: scroll 15s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes scroll {
          0% { transform: translateX(0); }
          100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
        }
      }

      .grid-section {
        margin-top: 8rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
        gap: 0;
        border: 4px solid var(--fg);
        background: var(--fg);

        .card {
          background: var(--bg);
          padding: 3rem;
          border: 2px solid var(--fg);
          transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
          
          &:hover {
            background: var(--accent2);
            color: var(--bg);
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            z-index: 2;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--fg);

            h3 { color: var(--bg); }
          }

          h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent);
          }
        }
      }

      .status {
        margin-top: 8rem;
        padding: 4rem;
        background: var(--fg);
        color: var(--bg);

        h2 {
          font-family: var(--font-display);
          font-size: 4rem;
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
          color: var(--accent);
        }

        ul {
          list-style: none;
          font-size: 1.5rem;
          
          li {
            padding: 1rem 0;
            border-bottom: 2px dashed #444;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;

            .badge {
              background: var(--accent);
              color: var(--fg);
              padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;
              font-family: var(--font-display);
              font-size: 1rem;
              font-weight: bold;
              border-radius: 4px;
            }
          }
        }
      }

    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="noise"></div>
    <header>
      <div class="logo">Gosub</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#github">GitHub</a>
        <a href="#join">Join Dev</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <h1>The Web <span>Rebuilt.</span></h1>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>A truly modular browser engine built from scratch in Rust. No forks. No baggage. Just clean, composable components that put you in control.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="marquee">
        <div class="marquee-inner">
          BREAK THE MONOCULTURE • NO CORPORATE AGENDA • BUILD YOUR OWN BROWSER • MODULAR ARCHITECTURE • BREAK THE MONOCULTURE • NO CORPORATE AGENDA • BUILD YOUR OWN BROWSER • MODULAR ARCHITECTURE • 
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="grid-section">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Modular</h3>
          <p>Trait-based architecture. Swap out the JS engine, renderer, or layout system without forking. It's your browser.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Rust Built</h3>
          <p>Memory safety without garbage collection. Concurrency without data races. Performance without sacrificing security.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Open</h3>
          <p>MIT Licensed. Built by volunteers. Not a wrapper around existing engines. We are building the fourth alternative.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="status">
        <h2>Engine Status</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>HTML5 Parser <span class="badge">Valid DOM</span></li>
          <li>CSS3 Parser <span class="badge">Full AST</span></li>
          <li>Vello Renderer <span class="badge">GPU Accelerated</span></li>
          <li>Networking <span class="badge">HTTP Cache</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
